spans.s:
nṛ-pa, m. (guardian of men), prince, 🞄king: -kārya, n. business of a king;
 -kriyā, f. rule, dominion;
 -gṛha, n. palace;
 🞄-jana, m. sg. (coll.) the princes.

nṛpa-tva, n. sovereignty;
 -dīpa, m. 🞄prince like a lamp;
 -nīti, f. kingcraft;
 -mandira, n. palace;
 -liṅga, n. royal emblem.

nṛpa-vallabha, m. royal favourite;
 🞄-śreṣṭha, spv. best of kings;
 -suta, m. prince: 🞄ā, f. princess;
 -snuṣā, f. kingʼs daughter-in-law.

nṛpa‿aṅgaṇa, n. royal court;
 -aṅgana, n. id.: ā, f. princess, queen;
 -ātmaja, 🞄m. prince: ā, f. princess;
 -aryaman, m. 🞄sun among princes.

nṛpa‿ālaya, m. palace;
 -āsana, n. 🞄throne;
 -āspada, n. palace;
 -icchā, f. royal 🞄pleasure.
